            </section>

             <section id="schedule" class="mb-12 focused-calm-card p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm">
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold focused-calm-primary mb-4">Cronograma Semanal Otimizado</h2>
                <p class="focused-calm-secondary mb-6">Seus horários de deslocamento agora são blocos de estudo. Clique em um dia para ver os detalhes ou filtre para focar.</p>

                <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between mb-6 gap-4">
                    <div id="day-buttons" class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                        <button class="day-button px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full transition duration-200" data-day="seg">Seg</button>
                        <button class="day-button px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full transition duration-200" data-day="ter">Ter</button>
                        <button class="day-button px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full transition duration-200" data-day="qua">Qua</button>
                        <button class="day-button px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full transition duration-200" data-day="qui">Qui</button>
                        <button class="day-button px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full transition duration-200" data-day="sex">Sex</button>
                        <button class="day-button px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full transition duration-200" data-day="sab">Sáb</button>
                        <button class="day-button px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full transition duration-200" data-day="dom">Dom</button>
